    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305740/extras/1a5674e2e002bc4c510ebe74831891fa.webp?t=1731949290\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305740/extras/2d19e26c7528e4014577642113bca2e1.poster.avif?t=1731949290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305740/extras/2d19e26c7528e4014577642113bca2e1.webm?t=1731949290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305740/extras/2d19e26c7528e4014577642113bca2e1.mp4?t=1731949290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Miami Horizon 2077</strong> is a 2D arcade game inspired by the GTA franchise cop chase experience. Enter a futuristic world setting in 2077 as a young street hustler attempting to make a name for himself in the criminal underworld by trying to pull off a series of dangerous street robbery where the likelihood of escape is almost impossible<br>-Each run will start with a huge amount of money that you have just stolen from the heist. Your job is to avoid law enforcement and secure the money after a period of time.\u00a0If you survive, you will be able to keep that money to buy upgrades and cars for your next heist.<br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Arcade based gameplay</strong> with high replayability value<br>       </li><li><strong>Collects cash and armory</strong> on the way to your freedom<br>       </li><li><strong>Many different cars</strong> for you to collect and style on the street <br>       </li><li><strong>Changing the radio music</strong> to fit your taste while fighting your way out <br>       </li><li><strong>Boss Fight mode<br>       </strong></li><li><strong>Atmospheric retro vibe</strong> that will make you feel like a 80s hero</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305740/extras/1a5674e2e002bc4c510ebe74831891fa.webp?t=1731949290\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305740/extras/2d19e26c7528e4014577642113bca2e1.poster.avif?t=1731949290\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305740/extras/2d19e26c7528e4014577642113bca2e1.webm?t=1731949290\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2305740/extras/2d19e26c7528e4014577642113bca2e1.mp4?t=1731949290\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Miami Horizon 2077</strong> is a 2D arcade game inspired by the GTA franchise cop chase experience. Enter a futuristic world setting in 2077 as a young street hustler attempting to make a name for himself in the criminal underworld by trying to pull off a series of dangerous street robbery where the likelihood of escape is almost impossible<br>-Each run will start with a huge amount of money that you have just stolen from the heist. Your job is to avoid law enforcement and secure the money after a period of time.\u00a0If you survive, you will be able to keep that money to buy upgrades and cars for your next heist.<br><strong>FEATURES</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Arcade based gameplay</strong> with high replayability value<br>       </li><li><strong>Collects cash and armory</strong> on the way to your freedom<br>       </li><li><strong>Many different cars</strong> for you to collect and style on the street <br>       </li><li><strong>Changing the radio music</strong> to fit your taste while fighting your way out <br>       </li><li><strong>Boss Fight mode<br>       </strong></li><li><strong>Atmospheric retro vibe</strong> that will make you feel like a 80s hero</li></ul>",
